# Keep the build context to what `Containerfile` copies: no venv, no git, no seeded data, no
# worktrees, no egg-info from an editable install. A local `.venv` in the context would otherwise be
# copied nowhere but still uploaded, and `data/` holds whatever the last local run seeded.
.git
.github
.claude
.venv
.venv-audit
data
tests
*.egg-info
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.smoke
.smoke-*.log
.audit-requirements.txt
.env
*.pem
*.key
